title: VDO_Start
---
// ================================================================
// VDO_Rec.yarn — a hands-free run for recording video.
// Each character walks in at their DEMO_3Days.yarn spot, the camera focuses on
// them, and they show Neutral -> (order + a simulated cocktail) -> Happy -> Sad,
// each beat about 5 seconds, with their lines from DEMO_3Days.yarn.
//
// Run: on [GameLoop] › FlowWiring set Day Schedule to DaySchedule_VDO
//      (Assets/[02]Script/Day Schedule/), then Play and turn AutoPlay ON (HUD
//      button) so lines advance by themselves. Set the schedule back afterwards.
//
// Beat length: AutoPlay holds a line for 0.3 s + 0.03 s per letter after it has
// typed, then the <<wait_scene>> after it holds the pose. Change those numbers to retime.
//
// Spots and cameras (DEMO_3Days.yarn): spot 1 = Char1Cam, 2 = Char2Cam, 3 = Char3Cam.
//   Walter 1, Isla 2, Owen 3 (day 1) · Cole 2, Eliana 3 (day 2) · Faye 1, Arthur 3 (day 3)
// Characters without Happy / Sad pictures use the closest ones:
//   Eliana Sad = Disappointed · Arthur Happy = Mockery, Arthur Sad = Angry
// ================================================================
<<declare $vdo_order = "">>
<<eventlog_clear>>
// Opens the bar (the chapter title plays first, the next line waits for it).
<<flow_open_bar>>
<<jump VDO_Walter>>
===

title: VDO_MakeDrink
---
// Simulated cocktail: Yarn walks every step so the camera and stations show on screen.
// No ingredients go in, so nothing is scored; the reactions after it are acted out.
<<flow_minigame Shaking>>
<<flow_prepare_drinks>>
<<wait_scene 2.5>>
<<flow_ingredient_added>>
<<wait_scene 2.5>>
<<flow_drink_complete>>
<<wait_scene 2.5>>
<<flow_garnish_done>>
<<wait_scene 2>>
<<flow_serve_done>>
<<Reset_Variable SystemGame>>
===

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Day 1 positions — Walter 1, Isla 2, Owen 3
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title: VDO_Walter
---
<<Walter Enter 1>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char1Cam>>

<<Walter Neutral>>
Walter: Good evening.[waitfor=0.2/] It's been a long time since I last saw someone open something new in this town. #line:07ccf74 
<<wait_scene 1>>

<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Walter>>
Walter: Just keep it simple, son. #line:0b45d25 
Walter: [order] "{Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Sea Breeze")}" [/order] should be enough for tonight. #line:0e84752 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char1Cam>>

<<Walter Happy>>
Walter: [bounce]Spot on, son.[/bounce] [wave]Balanced and clean.[/wave] #line:014724d 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Walter Sad>>
Walter: [shake]I don't think this is what I asked for.[/shake] #line:0b465e2 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Walter Neutral>>
<<jump VDO_Isla>>
===

title: VDO_Isla
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Isla Enter 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>

<<Isla Neutral>>
Isla: Did you just move here? #line:02525f5 
<<wait_scene 3>>

<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Isla>>
Isla: Okay, I'll have [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Cranberry Fizz")} [/order]. #line:0bb3951 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>

<<Isla Happy>>
Isla: [bounce]Oh, wow... this is incredible.[/bounce] #line:0bceb0e 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Isla Sad>>
Isla: [shake]Uh... Bartender?[/shake] I think you might have grabbed the wrong bottle. #line:08a509d 
<<wait_scene 1.5>>

<<Isla Neutral>>
<<jump VDO_Owen>>
===

title: VDO_Owen
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Owen Enter 3>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

<<Owen Neutral>>
Owen: Oh right, I should probably order before the bartender kicks me out. #line:0c794ea 
<<wait_scene 1.5>>

<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Owen>>
Owen: I'll have [order] {Order_Cocktail_ByName_OutName("Gin Fizz")}. [/order] #line:085a626 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

<<Owen Happy>>
Owen: [shake][rainb]Unbelievable![/rainb][/shake] This is amazing. #line:05b3331 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Owen Sad>>
Owen: Hmm...[waitfor=0.2/] I hate to say it, but I think something went sideways here. #line:000b1e3 
<<wait_scene 1>>

<<Owen Neutral>>
// Day 1 group leaves; Walter stays for day 2 (spot 1 in both days).
<<Isla Exit>>
<<Owen Exit>>
<<jump VDO_Cole>>
===

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Day 2 positions — (Walter 1), Cole 2, Eliana 3
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title: VDO_Cole
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Cole Enter 2>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>

<<Cole Neutral>>
Cole: Long shift. Needed somewhere quiet. #line:082c561 
<<wait_scene 3>>

Cole: Just get me [order]{Order_Cocktail_OutName(1)}[/order]. Nothing complicated. #line:014a797 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char2Cam>>

<<Cole Happy>>
Cole: Huh. Not bad. Didn't expect much, honestly. #line:026c5f9 
<<wait_scene 2>>

<<Cole Sad>>
Cole: ...You sure you made this right? #line:09ca0f7 
<<wait_scene 3>>

<<Cole Neutral>>
<<jump VDO_Eliana>>
===

title: VDO_Eliana
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Eliana Enter 3>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

<<Eliana Neutral>>
Eliana: I'm Eliana, by the way. I'm the town lawyer. #line:0079a48 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<order_customer "[CocktailSystem]" Eliana>>
<<order_by_type "[CocktailSystem]" HighAlcohol>>
Eliana: Surprise me. Something strong. I earned it today. #line:00553c2 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

<<Eliana Happy>>
Eliana: Okay, that's exactly what I needed. #line:0670f3b 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

// Eliana has no Sad picture: Disappointed.
<<Eliana Disappointed>>
Eliana: Rough day, rough drink. Seems about right. #line:0bb640f 
<<wait_scene 2>>

<<Eliana Neutral>>
<<Walter Exit>>
<<Cole Exit>>
<<Eliana Exit>>
<<jump VDO_Faye>>
===

// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
//  Day 3 positions — Faye 1, Arthur 3
// ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

title: VDO_Faye
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Faye Enter 1>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char1Cam>>

<<Faye Neutral>>
Faye: Just looking for a quiet corner tonight, if that's alright. #line:0a69461 
<<wait_scene 2>>

<<set $vdo_order = Order_Cocktail_OutName(4)>>
Faye: Something dry, please. Nothing fruity. #line:008bde0 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char1Cam>>

<<Faye Happy>>
Faye: Hm. Not bad. #line:066f975 
<<wait_scene 3.5>>

<<Faye Sad>>
Faye: Goodness, what did you make? #line:08c9c2a 
<<wait_scene 3>>

<<Faye Neutral>>
<<jump VDO_Arthur>>
===

title: VDO_Arthur
---
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
<<Arthur Enter 3>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

<<Arthur Neutral>>
Arthur: Huh. So this is the new spot everyone's talking about. #line:0948f7c 
<<wait_scene 2>>

<<set $vdo_order = Order_Cocktail_OutName(8)>>
<<Arthur HandIn>>
Arthur: Whatever's expensive and good. I'll know if it's not. #line:061e9cc 
<<detour VDO_MakeDrink>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController Char3Cam>>

// Arthur has no Happy / Sad pictures: Mockery (smirk) and Angry.
<<Arthur Mockery>>
Arthur: Huh. Actually good. Wasn't expecting that. #line:02c1b2e 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Arthur Angry>>
Arthur: This is... not it. Try again sometime, maybe. #line:00e3095 
<<wait_scene 2.5>>

<<Arthur Neutral>>
<<Faye Exit>>
<<Arthur Exit>>
<<Switch_Camera CamController "MainCam">>
// End of the recording.
===
